# Apps a child's launcher shows, by desktop id, until a grown-up keeps their
# own list in /etc/omarchy/child-apps (Setup > Users > Child Apps). Everything
# else stays installed and hidden. This curates what a child sees; it is not a
# lock on what can run.
omarchy-browser
chromium
org.gnome.Nautilus
imv
mpv
org.gnome.Calculator
libreoffice-startcenter
libreoffice-writer
libreoffice-calc
libreoffice-impress
org.kde.gcompris
tuxpaint
